             '│  ⇉ SANKEY  ● LIVE [════█═══]  live   ⏻ KILL CONNECTION        │\n'
             '│  ☑Legend  ⊕ GEO MAP  🖧 LAN SCAN  ⊛ SPREAD                     │\n'
